#     NaCl    0.6646   band 0.66-0.69   IN
#     KCl     0.6381   band 0.62-0.65   IN
#     MgCl2   0.4608   band 0.47-0.50   BELOW
#     CaCl2   0.4459   band 0.46-0.50   BELOW
#     Na2SO4  0.3489   band 0.36-0.40   BELOW
#     MgSO4   0.1460   band 0.15-0.20   BELOW
